WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.620
Everybody out there ready to learn another new dance?

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:05.150
Well, then get up and follow along with me.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.700
I'll talk you through it slowly the first time.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:10.300
Stretch your neck.

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:13.810
Wing your tail.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:22.810
What you ought to look like when you do the brontosaurus bounce.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:52.190
You swing your tail to the left, backwards, you swing your tail to the right, forward, forward, a little.

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:54.660
to the right because pretty soon we're gonna dance the brontosaurus bounce again
